  "question": {
    "text": "Time period of a simple pendulum is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi></math> inside a lift when the lift is stationary. If the lift moves upwards with an acceleration <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>g</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>, the time period of pendulum will be :"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>T</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>T</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msqrt><mi>T</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msqrt><mi>T</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>When lift is stationary&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><msqrt><mfrac><mi>L</mi><mi>g</mi></mfrac></msqrt></math></p><p>When lift is moving upwards</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> Pseudo force acts downwards</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>eff</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>g</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>g</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> New time period</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>T</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><msqrt><mfrac><mi>L</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>eff</mi></msub></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>L</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>g</mi></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>T</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msqrt><mi>T</mi></math></p>"
  }
}